  "question": {
    "text": "An ac current is represented as<br/>$\\mathrm{i}=5 \\sqrt{2}+10 \\cos \\left(650 \\pi \\mathrm{t}+\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right) \\mathrm{Amp}$<br/>The r.m.s value of the current is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "50 Amp",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "100 Amp",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "10 Amp",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "$5 \\sqrt{2} \\mathrm{Amp}$",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "$i=5 \\sqrt{2}+10 \\cos \\left(650 \\pi t+\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)$<br/>$\\mathrm{i}^2=50+100 \\cos ^2\\left(650 \\pi \\mathrm{t}+\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)$<br/>$+(2)(5 \\sqrt{2})(10) \\cos \\left(650 \\pi t+\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)$<br/>$\\left\\langle\\mathrm{i}^2\\right\\rangle=50+\\frac{100}{2}+0$<br/>$\\left. \\lt \\mathrm{i}^2\\right\\rangle=100$<br/>$ \\lt \\mathrm{i} \\gt =10 \\mathrm{Amp}$"
  }
